function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]})}
function cur(){var d=window.db;if(d&&typeof d==='object')return d;try{return JSON.parse(PLS.getItem(MAIN)||'{}')}catch(e){return {}}}
function idOf(o){return String(o&&(o.id!=null?o.id:o.orderNumber!=null?o.orderNumber:o.number!=null?o.number:'')||'')}
function openIDB(){return new Promise(function(res,rej){try{var r=indexedDB.open('emd_protect_v66',1);r.onsuccess=function(){res(r.result)};r.onerror=function(){rej(r.error)};r.onblocked=function(){rej(new Error('blocked'))}}catch(e){rej(e)}})}
